  "description": "The near future. Falling marriage rates, shrinking population.  \nMarriage is no longer love, but an investment.  \n\"That investment, we're here to help.\"\n\n\"Marriage simulation\" that simulates a future married to the other person.  \nCouples contemplating marriage are forced to see each other's true colors.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=811716), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9821901)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/drama/simulasi-pernikahan/list?title_no=5600), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/city-office/marriage-simulation/list?title_no=5750), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003220)",
